{"meta":{"ui":"question_flow","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"generate","prompt":"Help me pick a laptop with a short question flow, one question at a time: what I use it for, then a second question that depends on that answer, then budget. Show progress, let me go back, and end on one recommendation with the reasons and a start over button.","text":"Card w:390 gap:12 pad:16\n  state step=1\n  state use=\"\"\n  state sub=\"\"\n  state budget=\"\"\n  Progress =step\n  if step==1\n    Text.title \"What will you mainly use it for?\"\n    Column gap:8\n      ChoiceChip \"Office and browsing\" -> use=\"office\"; step=2\n      ChoiceChip \"Creative work (photo, video)\" -> use=\"creative\"; step=2\n      ChoiceChip \"Gaming\" -> use=\"gaming\"; step=2\n      ChoiceChip \"Programming\" -> use=\"dev\"; step=2\n  if step==2 && use==\"creative\"\n    Text.title \"What kind of creative work?\"\n    Column gap:8\n      ChoiceChip \"Photo editing\" -> sub=\"photo\"; step=3\n      ChoiceChip \"Video editing\" -> sub=\"video\"; step=3\n      ChoiceChip \"3D and design\" -> sub=\"3d\"; step=3\n  if step==2 && use==\"gaming\"\n    Text.title \"What kind of games?\"\n    Column gap:8\n      ChoiceChip \"Light and indie\" -> sub=\"light\"; step=3\n      ChoiceChip \"AAA titles\" -> sub=\"aaa\"; step=3\n  if step==2 && use==\"office\"\n    Text.title \"How much do you travel with it?\"\n    Column gap:8\n      ChoiceChip \"Rarely, it stays at a desk\" -> sub=\"desk\"; step=3\n      ChoiceChip \"Often, I need it light\" -> sub=\"light\"; step=3\n  if step==2 && use==\"dev\"\n    Text.title \"What do you usually build?\"\n    Column gap:8\n      ChoiceChip \"Web and scripting\" -> sub=\"web\"; step=3\n      ChoiceChip \"Heavy builds, containers, ML\" -> sub=\"heavy\"; step=3\n  if step==3\n    Text.title \"What is your budget?\"\n    Column gap:8\n      ChoiceChip \"Under $800\" -> budget=\"low\"; step=4\n      ChoiceChip \"$800 to $1,500\" -> budget=\"mid\"; step=4\n      ChoiceChip \"Over $1,500\" -> budget=\"high\"; step=4\n  if step==4\n    Text.heading \"Our pick for you\"\n    if use==\"creative\" && budget==\"high\"\n      Text.strong \"Laptop with a 14-inch OLED display, 32 GB RAM, RTX 4070 graphics\"\n      Text.body \"Fast enough for large video timelines and colour-accurate photo work, and the screen suits editing.\"\n    if use==\"creative\" && budget!=\"high\"\n      Text.strong \"Laptop with a 14-inch display, 16 GB RAM, dedicated graphics\"\n      Text.body \"Handles photo and video editing well within your budget, with room to grow.\"\n    if use==\"gaming\" && budget==\"high\"\n      Text.strong \"Gaming laptop with RTX 4070 graphics, 32 GB RAM, 165 Hz screen\"\n      Text.body \"Runs AAA titles at high settings with smooth frame rates.\"\n    if use==\"gaming\" && budget!=\"high\"\n      Text.strong \"Gaming laptop with RTX 4060 graphics, 16 GB RAM\"\n      Text.body \"Plays current games well at medium to high settings for the price.\"\n    if use==\"dev\" && budget!=\"low\"\n      Text.strong \"Laptop with 32 GB RAM, fast SSD, and a six-core processor\"\n      Text.body \"Plenty of memory for containers, compiling, and local ML tasks.\"\n    if use==\"dev\" && budget==\"low\"\n      Text.strong \"Laptop with 16 GB RAM and a fast SSD\"\n      Text.body \"Handles coding, scripting, and web development comfortably.\"\n    if use==\"office\"\n      Text.strong \"Lightweight laptop with 16 GB RAM and all-day battery\"\n      Text.body \"Fast for email, documents, and browsing, and easy to carry.\"\n    Button.outline \"Start over\" -> step=1; use=\"\"; sub=\"\"; budget=\"\"\n  Row between\n    if step>1 && step<4\n      Button.ghost \"Back\" -> step=step-1\n    if step<=1\n      Spacer\n    Text.caption \"Step {step} of 4\"","usage":{"input_tokens":2363,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1405,"se